{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51944","headline":"朗州戏笔（二首） 二 · 吕岩","name":"朗州戏笔（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数年不到鼎城游，反掌俄经八十秋。\n刘氏宅爲张氏宅，谢家楼作李家楼。\n千金公子皆空手，三岁孩儿尽白头。\n惟有两般依旧在，青山长秀水长流。\n（嘉靖《常德府志》十九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}